interior designer,


01:17:34.560 --> 01:17:36.483
and style maverick
Iris Apfel.


01:17:36.640 --> 01:17:39.883
Today, Mrs. Apfel remains
a popular, outspoken,


01:17:40.040 --> 01:17:42.407
